{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/d3a49791de8757805ad2bb0bb5a8b40a.poster.avif?t=1765444814\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/d3a49791de8757805ad2bb0bb5a8b40a.webm?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/d3a49791de8757805ad2bb0bb5a8b40a.mp4?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HEART-POUNDING DRAW</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your turn, draw items one by one. After each draw, face the choice: keep your loot or draw more and risk losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/f9c9dc187e720672d63f335bc96539f2.poster.avif?t=1765444814\" width=598 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/f9c9dc187e720672d63f335bc96539f2.webm?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/f9c9dc187e720672d63f335bc96539f2.mp4?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pool is a dynamic mix of valuable and dangerous items:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources:</strong> The foundation for crafting powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blueprints:</strong> Unlock new, game-changing crafting recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junk:</strong> Drawing two identical Junk items in a row <strong>interrupts your turn</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unstable Core:</strong> Drawing two of these <strong>interrupts your turn and deals damage!</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your loot to buy or craft special items that let you manipulate the pool, protect yourself, or sabotage your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/fd35d780ee223104b6d04e357936cea5.poster.avif?t=1765444814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/fd35d780ee223104b6d04e357936cea5.webm?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/fd35d780ee223104b6d04e357936cea5.mp4?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against friends and remember: this isn't about getting the most resources \u2014 it's about <strong>survival</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The last surviving player wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/c7e808f35457d75f3363b0333f58fb2c.poster.avif?t=1765444814\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/c7e808f35457d75f3363b0333f58fb2c.webm?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/c7e808f35457d75f3363b0333f58fb2c.mp4?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/1eec030676831fbc1a9538c6241b97f7.poster.avif?t=1765444814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/1eec030676831fbc1a9538c6241b97f7.webm?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/1eec030676831fbc1a9538c6241b97f7.mp4?t=1765444814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017930?t=1765444814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/129774fab54772eeb343f24146439a9873fa7502/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765444814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/36d3c855acdbc8007ff822ca023f13d10f279465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765444814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/36d3c855acdbc8007ff822ca023f13d10f279465/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765444814","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/d3a49791de8757805ad2bb0bb5a8b40a.poster.avif?t=1765444814\" width=600 height=